    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/5cfae5ab83977a095b705931d7bd1d4a.avif?t=1744511454\" width=620 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bumble Brawlers is an exhilarating top-down shooter that lets you dive into chaotic battles with fully customizable characters, unique companions, and powerful upgrades. Enter a world where survival is your only goal as you navigate dungeons, face endless enemy waves, and conquer a series of challenging maps with wave-based combat.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/94774b6f72c899412627644a3ba4b1fb.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a variety of customization options. From headgear to armor, shape your warrior to match your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Upgrade Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/2e02900d0512c9dc13ecbcaeb76d0d3d.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loyal companions to fight by your side. Each companion brings unique abilities to help you survive intense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Powerful Weapons and Armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/5664b9f3ddf0650917c48ec38a3c6c48.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your warrior with an arsenal of weapons and armor. Unlock new gear as you progress, each piece tailored to different playstyles and strategic needs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Intense Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.poster.avif?t=1744511454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.webm?t=1744511454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.mp4?t=1744511454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Mode: Venture into dungeons packed with enemies. Only the strongest will survive these unforgiving labyrinths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blitz Mode: An endless onslaught of enemies! Test your skills and endurance as you battle wave after wave, aiming for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-Based Map Challenges: Strategically take on several waves in challenging maps. Master these scenarios to prove your worth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactile Controls and Dynamic Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tight controls designed for quick reflexes and fast-paced combat, all set within diverse environments that evolve with each round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/2290605b5de9ea975fd4f2ef5c2195e9.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards, unlock achievements, and push your warrior to new limits. With endless ways to play, Bumble Brawlers keeps every run fresh and exciting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Bumble Brawlers?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumble Brawlers brings together the thrill of survival shooters with deep character customization and endless challenges. Whether fighting through dungeons, testing your endurance in blitz mode, or conquering maps in wave-based challenges, every experience is filled with unique encounters and strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for epic battles, hone your skills, and fight your way to victory in Bumble Brawlers \u2013 where survival is only the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/5cfae5ab83977a095b705931d7bd1d4a.avif?t=1744511454\" width=620 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Bumble Brawlers is an exhilarating top-down shooter that lets you dive into chaotic battles with fully customizable characters, unique companions, and powerful upgrades. Enter a world where survival is your only goal as you navigate dungeons, face endless enemy waves, and conquer a series of challenging maps with wave-based combat.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Character</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/94774b6f72c899412627644a3ba4b1fb.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a variety of customization options. From headgear to armor, shape your warrior to match your style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock and Upgrade Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/2e02900d0512c9dc13ecbcaeb76d0d3d.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find loyal companions to fight by your side. Each companion brings unique abilities to help you survive intense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Powerful Weapons and Armor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/5664b9f3ddf0650917c48ec38a3c6c48.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=436 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your warrior with an arsenal of weapons and armor. Unlock new gear as you progress, each piece tailored to different playstyles and strategic needs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Intense Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.poster.avif?t=1744511454\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.webm?t=1744511454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/54c1be091873b1d1183a35975ab153e9.mp4?t=1744511454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeon Mode: Venture into dungeons packed with enemies. Only the strongest will survive these unforgiving labyrinths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blitz Mode: An endless onslaught of enemies! Test your skills and endurance as you battle wave after wave, aiming for the highest score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave-Based Map Challenges: Strategically take on several waves in challenging maps. Master these scenarios to prove your worth.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactile Controls and Dynamic Environments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy tight controls designed for quick reflexes and fast-paced combat, all set within diverse environments that evolve with each round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351770/extras/2290605b5de9ea975fd4f2ef5c2195e9.avif?t=1744511454\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn rewards, unlock achievements, and push your warrior to new limits. With endless ways to play, Bumble Brawlers keeps every run fresh and exciting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Bumble Brawlers?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bumble Brawlers brings together the thrill of survival shooters with deep character customization and endless challenges. Whether fighting through dungeons, testing your endurance in blitz mode, or conquering maps in wave-based challenges, every experience is filled with unique encounters and strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for epic battles, hone your skills, and fight your way to victory in Bumble Brawlers \u2013 where survival is only the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Bumble Brawlers is an action-packed top-down shooter. Customize characters, battle endless waves, survive dungeon raids, and unlock companions, weapons, and armor. Fight to conquer maps and test your skills in challenging blitz modes and wave-based arenas!",
